================================================================================
AD BLOCKING SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE AND IMPLEMENTATION OVERVIEW
================================================================================

This document details the multi-tiered ad blocking, cosmetic filtering, anti-adblock
defusion, interactive element picking, custom user scriptlet execution, and cloud
state synchronization architecture implemented across this browser.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. ARCHITECTURAL OVERVIEW & DEFENSE PIPELINE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ad blocking is not merely client-side JavaScript injection or a static host list.
It operates as a coordinated, seven-layer defense pipeline spanning native Android
Java interception, typed synthetic responses, early DOM defusion, interactive element
pruning, custom user scriptlets, and Cloudflare KV state synchronization:

  [Inbound Web Resource Request]
                 |
                 v
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
  | LAYER 1: Native Network Interception                        |
  | (PrivacyWebViewClient.shouldInterceptRequest)               |
  | - Intercepts all subresources (scripts, CSS, XHR, iframes)  |
  | - Evaluates URLs against AdBlockManager and blockedHosts    |
  | - O(1) hash set matching with domain hierarchy fallback     |
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
                 |
                 +--> [If Allowed] --> Passes to network
                 |
                 +--> [If Blocked]
                         |
                         v
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
  | LAYER 2: Synthetic Benign Response Engine                   |
  | (PrivacyWebViewClient)                                      |
  | - Emits HTTP 200 OK (never 403 / connection drop) to avoid  |
  |   Chromium "Webpage not available" dinosaur error frames    |
  | - Emits typed payloads (1x1 PNG, empty JS/CSS, empty JSON)  |
  | - Emits self-collapsing, zero-dimension HTML for iframes   |
  | - Injects permissive CORS and Access-Control headers        |
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
                         |
                         v
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
  | LAYER 3: DOM Defusion & Cosmetic Pruning Engine             |
  | (AntiAdblockDefuser.java injected at document_start)        |
  | - Early proxy stubs: adsbygoogle, google_ad_client, etc.   |
  | - Collapses ad placeholders (.adHolder, billboard, mpu)     |
  | - Safeguards article content (<article>, <main>, <p>)       |
  | - MutationObserver collapses dynamically injected ad slots  |
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
                         |
                         v
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
  | LAYER 4: Specialized Feature Defusers                       |
  | - PopupClickDefuser: Blocks non-gesture window.open calls   |
  |   and neutralizes invisible clickjacking overlay divs       |
  | - YouTubeAdDefuser: Strips adPlacements from player configs |
  |   and hooks JSON.parse / fetch to prevent in-stream ads     |
  | - UserFiltersManager: Compiles uBlock-format rules          |
  |   (||domain^, @@||whitelist^, domain##selector)             |
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
                         |
                         v
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
  | LAYER 5: Interactive Visual Element Picker & Zapper         |
  | (ElementPickerEngine, ElementPickerBridge, Dialog)          |
  | - Visual DOM highlighter with semi-transparent overlay      |
  | - Dynamic opacity slider (10% to 100%) for visual clarity   |
  | - Specificity selector chips, live test preview toggle      |
  | - One-tap Element Zapper for instant client-side removal    |
  | - Direct compilation into UserFiltersManager storage        |
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
                         |
                         v
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
  | LAYER 6: Dynamic Custom User Scriptlet Engine               |
  | (UserScriptManager, AdBlockFileManager, Creator Dialog)     |
  | - In-app scriptlet creation with 6 built-in starter presets |
  |   (Blank, window.open, ytInitialPlayerResponse, adsbygoogle,|
  |    fetch/XHR hook, MutationObserver DOM pruner)             |
  | - Metadata header parsing: @name, @run-at, @match, @enabled |
  | - Dual-timing injection: document-start (WebViewCompat/     |
  |   onPageStarted) vs document-end (onPageFinished)           |
  | - Hot-reloading and timing toggle in Rules & Scripts editor |
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
                         |
                         v
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+
  | LAYER 7: Cloud State Synchronization & Snapshot Versioning  |
  | (AdBlockCloudClient, AdBlockDiffEngine, CloudStatesDialog)  |
  | - Cloudflare KV storage sync for hosts, rules, and scripts  |
  | - Commit history, state snapshot rollbacks, differential    |
  |   merge restore, and conflict resolution                    |
  +-------------------------------------------------------------+

