4. IN-APP IDE & RULES / SCRIPTS MANAGER (AdBlockModuleManagerDialog)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A full-featured in-app code editor and management studio accessible via browser settings:
- Active Tabs:
  * Network: Edit blocked hostnames (hosts.txt) with instant validation.
  * Cosmetic: Edit CSS cosmetic rules (cosmetic_rules.txt).
  * Built-in Scripts: Edit anti-adblock, cosmetic pruner, popup, and YouTube defusers.
  * User Scripts: Dynamically generated tabs for each user scriptlet in user_scripts/.
- Editor Features:
  * Monospace font with syntax highlighting container.
  * Line numbering and active cursor line tracking.
  * Hot-Reload: Applies modified rules or scripts to active WebViews immediately
    without requiring an application restart.
  * Timing Toggle: Live header button toggling script timing between document-start
    and document-end, automatically updating the @run-at header in the editor text.
  * Delete Script: Permanently deletes custom user scriptlets with confirmation.
  * Cloud States Access: One-tap button opening Cloudflare KV sync and history dialog.

